<view class="page"><view class="notice">骑手入驻 · 后端演示模式即时开通，不代表已完成真实实名认证、健康证明审核或培训。</view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">填写入驻资料</view><view class="field"><text class="label">手机号</text><input value="{{form.mobile}}" data-field="mobile" type="number" maxlength="11" bindinput="input" placeholder="用于骑手身份验证" disabled="{{busy || sending}}"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">真实姓名</text><input value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" maxlength="30" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入姓名" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">车牌号（选填）</text><input value="{{form.plateNo}}" data-field="plateNo" maxlength="20" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入车牌号" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view>
<view class="row"><input class="grow" value="{{form.code}}" data-field="code" type="number" maxlength="8" bindinput="input" placeholder="短信验证码" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button class="secondary small" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{busy || sending || cooling > 0}}" bindtap="sendCode">{{smsLabel}}</button></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{demoCode}}">后端演示验证码：{{demoCode}}（请手动填写）</view>
<checkbox-group class="field" bindchange="consent"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#176B52"/>同意提交上述资料用于骑手注册，并理解演示限制</label></checkbox-group><view class="link" bindtap="legal">查看资料与定位使用说明</view>
<button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || sending}}" bindtap="register">提交骑手入驻</button><view class="hint">沿用现有手机号骑手注册接口，不虚构微信与手机号账户合并。提交成功后以返回的骑手账户登录。</view>
</view></view>
